+# Active Storage services.
+#
+# Active Storage currently only holds the profile images of users and organizations (see HasProfileImage).
+# In production, files are stored next to CarrierWave's uploads, so that both libraries share the same
+# bucket, credentials, CDN and persistent volume while profile images move from one to the other.
+# config/environments/production.rb picks the service matching the CarrierWave configuration.
+
 test:
